      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TAW UNBOUND (5) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by half a length at this track in a handy 30.29. Awkwardly drawn but likes the trip. The form from his last run stacks up well. Well placed and will be tough to beat. PAR EXCELLENCE (2) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (30.63) from Box 1 at this track. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Deserves a win and gets his chance. GOBLIN (1) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing fourth (30.75) at this track in a Grade 4. Can hit the frame this time. PAW NILBERT (8) must be among the chances on the last run here.",
